Okay. Step on it.

988
00:42:25,833 --> 00:42:27,967
You're not that funny.

989
00:42:29,600 --> 00:42:31,200
- ( all gasp ) 
- Wow!

990
00:42:31,200 --> 00:42:33,133
Incredible!

991
00:42:36,667 --> 00:42:39,300
 "A Very Walton Radar Christmas."

992
00:42:40,567 --> 00:42:42,667
"The Joads Pull a Heist."

993
00:42:44,367 --> 00:42:46,933
 That is a full acre of car there.

994
00:42:46,933 --> 00:42:48,867
Yep.

995
00:42:48,867 --> 00:42:51,267
That damned Swatch.

996
00:42:53,300 --> 00:42:54,633
♪ Ride ♪

997
00:42:54,633 --> 00:42:56,833
♪ Riding like the demon ♪

998
00:42:56,833 --> 00:42:59,433
♪ That drives your dreams ♪

999
00:42:59,433 --> 00:43:00,800
"Hardcastle and McCormick."

1000
00:43:00,800 --> 00:43:02,967
"Hey, pull over. 
Gotta hang out the radar dish,

1001
00:43:02,967 --> 00:43:04,467
if you know what I mean."

1002
