"When AAA was controlled 
by the mob."

1003
00:43:09,867 --> 00:43:14,100
( hysterically imitating 
dramatic soundtrack )

1004
00:43:14,100 --> 00:43:16,400
- "Oh, you're here." 
- You have any trouble?

1005
00:43:16,400 --> 00:43:18,367
They never knew what hit 'em.

1006
00:43:18,367 --> 00:43:20,367
- You didn't knock them off? 
- Of course not.

1007
00:43:20,367 --> 00:43:22,267
They're just out cold.

1008
00:43:22,267 --> 00:43:24,300
 Well, dump 'em and head for the barn. 
 I'll meet you there.

1009
00:43:24,300 --> 00:43:26,833
 All this to plan a family reunion.

1010
00:43:28,333 --> 00:43:30,667
"Here, I'll drive. 
Oh, I'm the only one."

1011
