"Let's see. Dead body, dead... 
Where did I put that thing?

1012
00:43:35,333 --> 00:43:37,400
Oh, there it is."

1013
00:43:39,533 --> 00:43:41,533
( imitating engine )

1014
00:43:43,833 --> 00:43:47,300
"Damn you, Duke boys!"

1015
00:43:47,300 --> 00:43:50,767
( gibbering like 
Roscoe P. Coltrane )

1016
00:43:50,767 --> 00:43:52,267
The music bespeaks tension,

1017
