That must be it. 
Turn in there.

1020
00:43:59,167 --> 00:44:01,833
 "You said this wouldn't be fun."

1021
00:44:01,833 --> 00:44:04,300
"Colander Warehouse. 
All we do is colanders,

1022
00:44:04,300 --> 00:44:06,333
and we do them right."

1023
